  "title": "Perplexity AI Unleashes Multilingual Android Assistant to Rival Alexa and ChatGPT",
  "summary": "In a bold move, Perplexity AI has entered the Android AI assistant arena with its new multilingual assistant. This innovative tool promises to outshine competitors like ChatGPT, Siri, and Alexa by offering features such as booking reservations, setting reminders, and arranging rides in 15 different languages. Backed by tech giants and featuring a unique combination of search and real-world task execution, Perplexity AI is poised to make a significant impact in the AI space.",
